    "readingText": "TEXT A - Blog post format (T16-18 focus)\nHOBBY DAY - by Coco\nI don't work on Sundays. In the morning I swim, and\nat night I watch films - I love old films!\nBut today? It is raining, and it is very cold. So no\nwater for me! I am at home, and I am wearing my big\nwinter jacket.\nMy brother doesn't like films. He plays games all\nSunday. Do you like old films too?\n\nTEXT B - focus)\nNOTE FOR PAPA\nI am at the pharmacy - medicine for Mama. She has a\nheadache, and she can't work today. She is sleeping\nnow - please don't play music!\nAnd the cat is in the garden again. She can't eat\nthe flowers! Bring her in, please!\n- Fifi",
